#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1151 expect=noViolation domain=TI
#note "The PMDA-vs-FDA divergence pin, mirrored: renaming a criterion code between protocol versions is legitimate, so the TIVERS key must separate the two rows."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TI label="Trial Inclusion/Exclusion Criteria"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col IETESTCD type=Char
col IETEST   type=Char
col TIVERS   type=Char
---
S1 | TI | INCL01 | Age 18 years or older | 1
S1 | TI | INCL02 | Age 18 years or older | 2
